      {
        "name": "places/ChIJBflQH4IHBDQR_gswXaX3qJc/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pkRGRrcGZaRkZyV1hJdFpHVXhabTFWVDBsbVowRRAB",
        "relativePublishTimeDescription": "10 個月前",
        "rating": 2,
        "text": {
          "text": "今日我在該店食咗臘味木桶飯，店內環境寧靜，樓面（服務員）服務態度好。臘味木桶飯裡面有四片臘腸、一塊臘鴨、一塊臘肉。當中的臘肉根本咬唔到，或許本身食材質量就差，後生都咬唔到，更不要話長者啦。當樓面（服務員）幫忙去廚房詢問時，廚房卻傳來粗口的聲音，不但食材質量差，廚師素質都差👎 。就算食材質量差，廚師都可以切細塊d，而唔係爆粗口🤬\n\nToday, I ate cured-flavoured barrel rice in the store. The environment in the store was quiet, and the service attitude of the floor (the waiter) was good. There are four slices of sausage, a piece of cured duck and a piece of bacon in the cured barrel rice. The bacon in it can't be chewed at all. Maybe the quality of the ingredients itself is poor, and the future can't bite it, let alone the elders. When the floor (the waiter) helped to go to the kitchen to inquire, there was a sound of dirty words in the kitchen. Not only the quality of the ingredients was poor, but also the quality of the chef👎. Even if the food is of poor quality, the chef can cut it into small pieces instead of swearing🤬",
          "languageCode": "zh-Hant"
        },
        "originalText": {
          "text": "今日我在該店食咗臘味木桶飯，店內環境寧靜，樓面（服務員）服務態度好。臘味木桶飯裡面有四片臘腸、一塊臘鴨、一塊臘肉。當中的臘肉根本咬唔到，或許本身食材質量就差，後生都咬唔到，更不要話長者啦。當樓面（服務員）幫忙去廚房詢問時，廚房卻傳來粗口的聲音，不但食材質量差，廚師素質都差👎 。就算食材質量差，廚師都可以切細塊d，而唔係爆粗口🤬\n\nToday, I ate cured-flavoured barrel rice in the store. The environment in the store was quiet, and the service attitude of the floor (the waiter) was good. There are four slices of sausage, a piece of cured duck and a piece of bacon in the cured barrel rice. The bacon in it can't be chewed at all. Maybe the quality of the ingredients itself is poor, and the future can't bite it, let alone the elders. When the floor (the waiter) helped to go to the kitchen to inquire, there was a sound of dirty words in the kitchen. Not only the quality of the ingredients was poor, but also the quality of the chef👎. Even if the food is of poor quality, the chef can cut it into small pieces instead of swearing🤬",
